# Optional Muse layer configuration (the deterministic core never
# needs a key and runs in full without one).
#
# Option 1 (environment):
#   set MUSE_API_KEY=<your key>
#   set MUSE_API_BASE=<endpoint base URL>
#
# Option 2 (gitignored folder; never commit real keys):
#   mkdir secrets
#   put the key alone in secrets/muse_api_key
#
# pqcheck reads the key from the environment first, then from
# secrets/. It never logs, prints, or puts the key in a report.
